# Fly-bian helpers (not Debian, not Armbian). Scripts, overlays, MOTD.
# Does not replace kernel, DTB, or U-Boot (those stay apt-held).
# Public repo is intended from Fly-bian 1.0 on GitHub Pages. Until that
# URL serves Packages, `apt update` will fail — use dpkg -i from a
# flybian-debs tarball instead (docs/howto-update.md).
Types: deb
URIs: https://0dysseusrex.github.io/fly-bian/apt
Suites: trixie
Components: main
Architectures: all
Trusted: yes
Enabled: no
